@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Crear Beca en Catálogo (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schoolarships
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beca de Excelencia Académica",
  "categoryId": "CAT_UUID_HERE"
}

### Listar Becas en Catálogo
GET {{baseUrl}}/schoolarships
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Asignar Beca a Alumno (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schoolarships/assign
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolarshipId": "SCHOLARSHIP_UUID_HERE",
  "startedAt": "2025-01-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2025-06-30T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Consultar Becas de un Alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/schoolarships/student/STUDENT_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Eliminar Asignación de Beca (Alumno propietario)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/schoolarships/assign/ASSIGNMENT_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
